@startuml 11-sequence-depart
' UML sequence diagram: a Départ, from choosing the car to sharing the sealed PDF (US-050 to US-057, US-044).
!include style.iuml
hide footbox
autonumber "<b>0."

actor "Staff" as staff
actor "Client" as client
participant "App\n(iPhone)" as app
participant "API +\nPostgreSQL" as api
participant "Storage" as st
participant "Documenso" as doc

== Vehicle, client, details · US-050 to US-052 ==
staff -> app : « Départ », car, renter (+ driver), dates, rates,\ndeductible, card (brand, last 4, expiry), typed amounts
app -> api : draft saved as it is typed
api --> app : car data, reference set, open damage, photo links (≤ 5 min)

== Departure condition · US-053 ==
staff -> app : km out, fuel out (pre-filled, adjustable)
opt extra or dashboard photos
  app -> api : ask for upload links
  app -> st : upload (new keys, insert-only)
end

== Preview · US-044, US-055 ==
staff -> app : recap complete, choose FR or EN
app -> api : preview
api -> api : check the car is free · contract « En attente de signature »\nreserve MCR-YYYY-NNNN (F-18) · render the PDF (Chromium)
api -> doc : create the envelope: client, a field\nin « Signature départ » on every page, no e-mails
api --> app : preview PDF
opt language switched (until the client signs)
  app -> api : preview in the other language
  api -> doc : delete the waiting envelope, create a new one
end

== Signature · US-054, US-057 ==
app -> client : Documenso's signing page, in a private web view
client -> doc : reads, draws once: every page signed (F-17)
doc -> doc : append the audit page · seal the whole PDF\nwith the company certificate
doc -> api : webhook: document completed (shared secret)
activate api #F6EFDC
api -> doc : download the sealed PDF · read back the signature image
api -> st : store the sealed PDF and the image, with SHA-256
api -> api : one transaction (sign_departure):\nrevision 1 frozen + snapshot SHA-256 · inspection\nsignature evidence · contract active · car rented · audit
deactivate api
app -> api : status?
api --> app : signed · contract number

== Delivery · US-042 ==
app -> st : download the sealed PDF (presigned link)
app -> staff : iOS share sheet
note over app, doc : No webhook yet? The status check makes the API ask Documenso.\nRepeated webhooks and retries are idempotent: never two contracts.
@enduml
